/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed90943981/2/prompt.md:343:Input structure:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed90943981/2/prompt.md:344:- Wall (0), bg (pipe fill), gate (horizontal 1×3 bars), token (small edge pixels).
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed90943981/2/prompt.md:345:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed90943981/2/prompt.md:346:Rule:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed90943981/2/prompt.md:347:- Rotate each gate into a vertical blocker; gate cells become bg.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed90943981/2/prompt.md:348:- Tokens drop downward through bg, choosing the extreme column for their side (left→min, right→max).
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed90943981/2/prompt.md:349:- Tokens settle at true pipe ends (adjacent to wall/boundary), packing inward.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed90943981/2/prompt.md:350:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed90943981/2/prompt.md:351:Key insight: Tokens select drop columns by entry side and land at wall-bounded endpoints, ignoring blocker-bounded ones.
